fety and allowing emergency services personnel... to plan and respond properly in the event of an emergency.\"\n*   **Section 7.2 (Change of Contact Information):** **Modified.** Added the requirement that notice of change must be in the \"Prescribed Form.\"\n*   **Section 8.1 (Termination on Notice):** **Modified.** Added the requirement that notice of termination must be in the \"Prescribed Form.\"\n*   **Section 9 (Amendment):** **Modified.** Added the requirement that amendments must be reduced to writing \"in the Prescribed Form.\"\n\n### **Appendix A – Definitions**\n*   **Domestic Content Level:** **Removed.**\n*   **Minimum Required Domestic Content Level:** **Removed.**\n*   **Prescribed Form:** **Added.** New definition: \"means, in relation to a form, the latest version of the corresponding form appearing on the Website...\"\n*   **Project Eligibility Requirements (c):** **Modified.** Added \"unless otherwise consented to by the OPA in writing in its sole and absolute discretion\" regarding facilities that have previously reached commercial operation.\n*   **Website:** **Added.** New definition: \"means the OPA’s Renewable Energy Feed-In Tariff Program website...\"\n\n### **Appendix C – Solar Photovoltaic Schedule**\n*   **Defined Terms (Existing Building):** **Modified.** Expanded to include buildings where the OPA \"in its sole and absolute discretion, issued a written confirmation that the building will be deemed an Existing Building.\"\n*   **Domestic Content Requirements (Sections 1.1 to 1.7 and Tables 1-3):** **Removed.** The entire regulatory framework for Domestic Content (Qualifying Percentages, Designated Activities, and Grids) has been deleted.\n\n### **Appendix D-1, D-2, and E**\n*   **No change.** (Note: Minor formatting/pagination differences only)."}, :node-id #uuid "82176ee3-956d-49ee-91c9-e7aa7761921d", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-started, :sheet-id #uuid "51930646-88b4-4b39-9b50-46560bef46c7", :event/id #uuid "019e4322-224c-70b1-bc