 a form found on the Website (as defined in Appendix A) could lead to the rejection of amendments or termination notices, potentially causing missed deadlines.\n   - **Validation:** Reference new definitions in Appendix A and requirements in Sections 8.1 and 9.\n\n4. **Eligibility Discretion (Impact: OPA):** \n   - **Risk Shift:** The **OPA** increases its \"sole and absolute discretion\" over project eligibility. While this provides a potential \"out\" for certain Suppliers to re-apply for contracts (Appendix A), it concentrates power in the OPA to act as a gatekeeper without objective criteria.\n   - **Validation:** Reference Appendix A \"Project Eligibility Requirements (c)\" and Appendix C \"Existing Building\" definitions."}, :node-id #uuid "cd6ac7bd-b725-4835-99b0-c10b563df6a5", :event/type :sheet/node-execution-started, :sheet-id #uuid "51930646-88b4-4b39-9b50-46560bef46c7", :event/id #uuid "019e4322-422e-7049-b269-b796610bde40"}, :mulog/root-trace #mulog/flake "5A3YsMtRlUMHkY5rluoy0AmzjxWnyG5f", :mulog/timestamp 1779242779183, :metric/name "TodoProcessed", :mulog/trace-id #mulog/flake "5A3YsMtRlUMHkY5rluoy0AmzjxWnyG5f", :mulog/event-name :ai.obney.grain.todo-processor-v2.core/processing-event, :metric/resolution :high}
